#: src/stack.c:710
msgid ""
"Print a stack for each thread in a process or core file.\n"
"\n"
"Program exits with return code 0 if all frames were shown without any errors.  If some frames were shown, but there were some non-fatal errors, possibly causing an incomplete backtrace, the program exits with return code 1.  If no frames could be shown, or a fatal error occurred the program exits with return code 2.  If the program was invoked with bad or missing arguments it will exit with return code 64."
msgstr ""
"Skriv ut en stack för varje tråd i en process- eller kärnfil.\n"
"\n"
"Programmet avslutas med returkoden 0 om alla ramar visades utan några fel. Om vissa ramar visades, men det fanns några icke-allvarliga fel som eventuellt orsakade en ofullständig backtrace, avslutas programmet med returkoden 1. Om inga ramar kunde visas eller om ett allvarligt fel inträffade avslutas programmet med returkoden 2. Om programmet startades med felaktiga eller saknade argument avslutas det med returkoden 64."

